  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(4, 16, 8)\n\n(2, 14, 9)\n\n**Logic:** Third no. = [(First no.) + (Second no. ÷ First no.)]\n\n**(4, 16, 8) →**\n\n⇒ [4 + (16 ÷ 4)]\n\n⇒ (4 + 4) = 8\n\n**(2, 14, 9) →**\n\n⇒ [2 + (14 ÷ 2)]\n\n⇒ (2 + 7) = 9\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1.** (2, 8, 10)\n\n⇒ [2 + (8 ÷ 2)]\n\n⇒ (2 + 4) = 6\n\n**2. (2, 8, 6)**\n\n⇒ [2 + (8 ÷ 2)]\n\n⇒ (2 + 4) = **6**\n\n**3.** (2, 8, 16)\n\n⇒ [2 + (8 ÷ 2)]\n\n⇒ (2 + 4) = 6\n\n**4.** (2, 8, 1)\n\n⇒ [2 + (8 ÷ 2)]\n\n⇒ (2 + 4) = 6\n\nHere, **(2, 8, 6)** shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
